\ Classical Stigler Diet Problem (Cost Minimization)
Minimize
 obj: 2.5 bread + 3.0 milk + 1.2 apple + 4.5 chicken
Subject To
 calories: 300 bread + 150 milk + 95 apple + 250 chicken >= 2000
 protein:  10 bread  + 8 milk   + 0.5 apple + 30 chicken >= 60
 calcium:  20 bread  + 300 milk + 10 apple  + 15 chicken >= 800
Bounds
 bread >= 0
 milk >= 0
 apple >= 0
 chicken >= 0
End
